<title>CANADA: Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - June 27.</title>
<headline>Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - June 27.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Gas Association (CGA) weekly survey of Canadian natural gas in storage in billion cubic feet (bcf) for the week ended June 27:</p>
<p>							 Pct Full  Pct Full</p>
<p>		 06/27/97  06/20/97  Pct Full  Week Ago  Year Ago</p>
<p>East	     67.78     57.16     29.2	24.6	28.9</p>
<p>West	    109.99    100.55     42.8	39.2	47.4</p>
<p>Total Canada  177.77    157.70     36.3	32.2	39.0</p>
<p>East-West division is the Manitoba/Saskatchewan and North Dakota/Minnesota borders.</p>
<p>East capacity 06/27/97: 232.55 bcf, 06/20/97: 232.55 bcf.</p>
</text>
